  "prompt": "复现论文《Towards scalable surrogate models based on Neural Fields for large scale aerodynamic simulations》中 MARIO（Modulated Aerodynamic Resolution Invariant Operator）的 AirfRANS Task scarce 实验 (https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.14704)。以论文为准，仅在论文未说明时参考官方仓库，禁止下载或复制官方仓库代码。数据路径为 /public/share/sugonhpcapp01/onestore/onedatasets/Transolver-Airfoil-Design/Dataset。模型脚本命名为 mario.py，核心类为 ModulatedFourierFeatures 和 MultiScaleModulatedFourierFeatures；训练脚本为 train_sdf.py、train.py，评测脚本为 evaluate.py，配置文件为 config_sdf.yaml、config_out.yaml。checkpoint、latent、曲线和评测结果统一保存到 trainings/，通过 print 或 tqdm 输出训练 loss 与评测指标。",
